<title>ITALY: Gross yield set at 7.19 pct at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield set at 7.19 pct at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a first tranche of 6.5 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 3.45 percent.</p>
<p>		   May 1, 2004 CCT		Pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   6.28 pct		5.72 pct</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 7.19 pct		6.56 pct</p>
<p>    Assigned price   99.05		   99.40</p>
<p>    Total bids	 10.385 trln lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    6.500 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Results are not directly comparable as the previous auction on April 15 was of a 3.0 trillion lire fifth tranche of 3.55 percent March 1, 2004 CCTs.</p>
</text>
